Z||000000||Greg Piet||05-09-2000||11:38 PM||||Since I started autocrossing, i got my friend hooked.<BR>He went and bought a first gen rx-7...  <BR>That way he gets to play with a rotary engine, and we will be in teh same class so we can "race" each other.<P>I went to sit in it since if one of our cars break we will drive the other ones, but I DONT FIT!<BR>My left knee is pinched by the steering wheel and the door handle!   I cant friggin believe  this!   Well there is one more car that I will never buy!  I have got to see if I will fit in a MR-2.  The new ones have promising performance specs... ||||reg||1
