Z||000008||bHooper||05-12-2000||07:51 AM||||I had a 2nd Generation RX-7, and fit in it just fine.  I'm 6-2, 180ish.  I looked at a 3rd generation RX7, fit fine in it.<P>The only car I have not been able to comfortably fit in was the Panoz Roadster... the little bugggeye looking thing... my knee hit the steering wheel and my elbow hit the shifter, with the seat all the way back!<P>I also don't like the seating position of the Testarossa.  I was in Davis Loves car, and jsut found it very unconfortable... no dead pedal!  But then again, I guess if you are driveing one, you are on the pedal's the whole time anyway!||||reg||1
